pwm-soft-dkms (2.0-1.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Non-maintainer upload.
  * Update driver to support 6.18 kernel: migrate to hrtimer_setup()
    in place of the removed hrtimer_init()/hr_timer.function pattern
  * Track exported GPIOs dynamically with a linked list instead of a
    fixed-size table indexed by GPIO number, removing the hardcoded
    1024-GPIO ceiling and the memory wasted preallocating a slot for
    every possible GPIO whether it's used or not; export_store now
    also validates the GPIO with gpio_is_valid() before use
  * debian: add dh-dkms to Build-Depends (needed for dh_dkms used
    in debian/rules)

 -- Gunjan Gupta <viraniac@gmail.com>  Sun, 05 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0530

